{
  "expressionSetApiName": "RLM_DefaultNearCorePricingProcedure",
  "versionApiName": "RLM_DefaultNearCorePricingProcedure_V1",
  "description": "BambooHR Path B Bundle & Save 15%: when Quote.RLM_Bamboo_PathB_BundleSave__c is true, apply ManualDiscount 15% on ListPrice for Payroll/Benefits lines (RLM_Bamboo_BundleSave_Target__c), after nonprofit list discount, before ABA/BBA/volume; copy NetUnitPrice back to InputUnitPrice so volume stacks once. Uses ListPrice (not InputUnitPrice) so Instant/System re-entry cannot compound the 15%. Path A package quotes keep BBA instead (flag false when BAMBOO-PKG-* present). NearCore twin.",
