      "RLM_Bamboo_BundleSave_Target__c (SalesTransactionItem)"
    ],
    "note": "Requires datasets/context_plans/BambooHrPathBBundleSave and nonprofit overlay already applied (placement after ApplyBambooHRNonprofitListDiscount)."
  },
